{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17843","headline":"赠毛仙翁 · 令狐楚","name":"赠毛仙翁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宣州浑是上清宫，客有真人貌似童。\n绀发垂缨光髧髧，细髯缘颔绿茸茸。\n壶中药物梯霞诀，肘後方书缩地功。\n既许焚香爲弟子，愿敎年纪共椿同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐楚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}